 1145 "Recall the following:\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *even* if $f(-x)=f(x)$\n\n- a function $f(x)$ is *odd* if $f(-x)=-f(x)$\n\nMoreover, for any odd function $f(x),$ the graph of $y=f(x)$ has rotational symmetry of order $2$ about the origin, so we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-a}^{a}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$\n\nNotice that $f(x)=x{e}^{{x}^{4}}$ is an odd function. Indeed, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(-x) & =(-x){e}^{(-x)^{4}} \\\\  & =-x{e}^{{x}^{4}} \\\\  & =-f(x).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, because $f(x)=x{e}^{{x}^{4}}$ is an odd function, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{1}x{e}^{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x=0.\n$$" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346773 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346774 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346775 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346776 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346777 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1041 "selection" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346777 13194139535382 true] [17592186346772 1110 #uuid "8ca7d0ce-68bd-5fe8-9eda-cf6645243508" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346773 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{1}x{e}^{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346773 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535382 true] [17592186346773 1111 #uuid "86baff91-0829-5b81-9da3-f645cfba8a3f" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346774 1034 "-4{\\int }_{0}^{1}x{e}^{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346774 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535382 true] [17592186346774 1111 #uuid "a55302ac-1828-5914-9048-101364834b51" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346775 1034 "4{\\int }_{0}^{1}x{e}^{{x}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346775 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535382 true] [17592186346775 1111 #uuid "b2107981-70bb-5b68-9161-64fd41deef1a" 13194139535382 true] [17592186346776 1034 "-{